{"id":"n30190-1-27","stage":1,"title":"시계 · 钟表","scene":"发现钟表不准","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n30190-1-27-1","ko":"이 시계는 고장이 난 것 같아.","zh":"这手表好像坏了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"시계는","meaning":"钟，表","explanation":"시계：钟，表；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"시계","audio":"/audio/a658dc1b94077c9f96de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30190","senseId":"1","lemma":"시계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시계는","audio":"/audio/d6fc37108aa1e46f276d.mp3"}},{"text":"고장이","meaning":"故障","explanation":"고장：故障；고장이 나다 合起来表示“出了故障”。","readings":[{"term":"고장","audio":"/audio/a1a759c684921a8dd35e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18856","senseId":"1","lemma":"고장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고장이","audio":"/audio/b777041e44a983a52170.mp3"}},{"text":"난","meaning":"出了（故障）","explanation":"나다：发生；고장이 난 表示“出了故障”，修饰后面的 것。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"7","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"난","audio":"/audio/f123177dde5fa8f48570.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"……似乎（것 같다）","explanation":"것 将前面的“出了故障”名词化，与 같다 合用表示推测。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL